  "id": 922,
  "description": "## 🇦🇺All Australians Welcome! 🇦🇺\n\n### Core Guild Values\n\n- **Self-Enablement:** Everyone is eligible for the Deputy role from consistent contributions.\n  - You have a right to use the benefits of the guild from our shared efforts. \n  - You are also entrusted with activities such as recruitment &amp; promotions.\n- **Welcoming:** We want a range of combat levels to join our guild as low level resource contributions are always appreciated. We expect you will grow with the guild and receive support whenever possible.\n  - If you choose to leave, you will always be welcomed back and at the same rank you were before.\n- **No Discord:** This is a Semi-Casual guild with no plans to go competitive. After all, this is a casual game for a majority of us and there are too many guilds with discord requirements.\n\n\\______________________________________________\n\n**🥅 Current Goals (Updated 11/09/2026)** \n- Contribute to stockpile\n- Have fun\n\n**📢 Announcement**\n\nLets try get some good Raids contributions for the start of Season 12. No pressure to be ultra competitive for the whole season but it would be a good chance to level up our Guild and show ourselves on the S12 leaderboard to attract new recruits.\n\n**Guild Update: 8 September** Thanks to those who have made guild contributions across the past week, especially those who have helped with stockpile &amp; challenges alongside raids. Welcome to Sneas and AlwaysDeasd as a new recruit, and a big thanks to MaxHunt for driving some recruitment activities in the Tavern. \n\nIt looks like Season 12 Assaults start next week. I am thinking to schedule a few casual Level 70 waves and a little bit of everywhere else (same as we have done in previous seasons). I will try manage the balance between assaulting a range of locations &amp; making sure we get a high enough score to secure some guild rewards at the end of the season.\n\\______________________________________________\n### Important Schedules\n\n**🕙 Raids Schedule (Subject To Supply)**\n- At this stage Deputies are free to schedule raids at times that suit them. We have a ridiculous amount of Marks to use up.\n- Generally 6pm, 8pm &amp; 9pm daily\n\n**⚔️ Assault Schedule**\n- Stay tuned for further details with Guild Season 12 starting this week.\n\n**🏊 Energising Pool**\n- Every Saturday Afternoon in September 12:00PM - 3:00PM\n\n\\______________________________________________\n\n### Hierarchy Progression\n\n**👑 Guild Leader Succession**\n\nIf a guild leader stops playing for a prolonged period, leadership will pass on to the most capable and willing deputy to continue our legacy.\n\n1. FabAsianZung (03/06/2025 - 31/08/2026)\n2. Drafiks (01/09/2026 - Current)\n3. N/A\n\n**🤴Promotion To Deputy**\n1. Consistent ingame activity. \n2. Consistent Guild Contributions, within 2 weeks of earning Officer rank. \n\n**👮‍♂️Promotion To Officer**\n1. Deputies are free to decide.\n2. Consistent Guild Contributions, within 2 weeks of earning Soldier rank. \n\n**🪖Promotion To Soldier**\n1. Deputies are free to decide, within 1 week of joining.\n2. Make an effort for guild contributions shortly after joining.\n\n**📃Accepting Recruit Applications**\n1. Combat level 40 or total level 500\n2. Ideally within Australia or a nearby region\n\n\\______________________________________________\n### Miscellaneous Extras\n\n- Alts are welcome in the guild however they may be kicked to make space for a new Main, based on lowest activity &amp; contributions.\n- We run by **AEST** (GMT+10) 🌏\n- If kicked for inactivity, feel free to come back when you are ready \n- New Zealanders are also welcome 🇳🇿\n\n**🚩Guild Founded: 3rd of June 2025 by FabAsianZung🚩**",
